-- NorthstarIQ — Sales acceptance and the accountable owner
--
-- ⚠️ LATER-CREATED REPRODUCIBILITY ARTIFACT — written 2026-09-02 AFTER the
-- Increment 7.1 controlled runtime validation had already been executed. This
-- file was NOT used during that validation and is not historical evidence of
-- anything. The field projection it uses is the one that WAS executed during
-- the run, narrowed there to the two fixtures by name; the accountability
-- predicate below is new and generalises it to the whole org.
--
-- Purpose: answer one question the eleven NorthstarIQ controls do not ask.
--
--   WHO IS ACCOUNTABLE FOR A LEAD SALES HAS ACCEPTED?
--
-- Sales_Accepted_By__c records who ASSERTED acceptance. OwnerId records who
-- HOLDS the record. Those are different business facts — the field description
-- on Sales_Accepted_By__c says so explicitly — and nothing in the deployed
-- architecture requires them to agree, or requires the owner to be a person at
-- all. Routing assigns Tier 3 Leads to a COVERAGE QUEUE at intake, and the
-- acceptance path in Lead_Inbound_Before_Save v13 writes three evidence fields
-- and never touches OwnerId.
--
-- So a Lead can carry complete, valid, policy-substantiated acceptance evidence
-- while remaining owned by a queue. Owner.Type tells them apart:
--
--   Owner.Type = 'User'   an individual person is accountable
--   Owner.Type = 'Queue'  a coverage pool holds it; nobody is individually
--                         accountable, and the acceptance says nothing about
--                         who will act
--
-- Runtime-confirmed 2026-09-02 by fixture S7-EXC (00Qaj00000vGBUvEAO), which
-- reached Status = SAL with all three acceptance evidence fields populated
-- while owned by NIQ North America Coverage. The save was permitted; no error
-- was raised. Compare S7-HAPPY (00Qaj00000vGBJdEAO), the same inputs with the
-- queue → seller handoff performed.
--
-- ⚠️ This query is a DIAGNOSTIC, not a control. No NorthstarIQ control read
-- Owner.Type as of the run above; every one of the eleven passed S7-EXC.

SELECT Id, Name, Company, Status,
       OwnerId, Owner.Name, Owner.Type,
       Territory__c, Routing_Reason__c,
       MQL_Basis__c,
       Sales_Accepted__c, Sales_Accepted_At__c,
       Sales_Accepted_By__c, Sales_Accepted_By__r.Name,
       Sales_Acceptance_Basis__c,
       Lifecycle_Stage_Entered__c
FROM Lead
WHERE Sales_Accepted_At__c != NULL
ORDER BY Sales_Accepted_At__c DESC
